 each with its pkg-config file: libomxdsp.a (omxdsp), libomxdsp-contracts.a
 (omxdsp-contracts, contracts compiled in) and libomxdsp-tsan.a (omxdsp-tsan,
 contracts and ThreadSanitizer). Programs link the library statically; no
 shared library exists.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.

