Description: LV2 adapter of omx-clap-host, as a static library to link
 libomx-clap-lv2 is the LV2 adapter omx-clap-host links in, for a program of
 your own that hosts plugins on libomx-clap-core: it loads an LV2 plugin
 through lilv as a real LV2 instance and maps the host interface, presenting
 the plugin's ports and controls as CLAP ports and parameters, with its
 latency, its own background worker and its default settings. It is a
 static library with its header and pkg-config file, linked at build time,
 and it loads lilv when the first LV2 bundle is opened, so a program that
 never opens one never needs lilv. LV2 at run time is omx-clap-host with
 liblilv-0-0, which plugin-hostd also runs as the worker of an LV2 plugin.
 .
 Its documentation is on openmixer.org.

